# VS Code REST Client. Set ownerPassword to the EXISTING seeded password locally.
# Do not commit real credentials. Execute login before authenticated requests.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerEmail = hoangdv955@gmail.com
@ownerPassword = REPLACE_WITH_SEEDED_PASSWORD
@roomId = REPLACE_WITH_ROOM_UUID
@contractId = REPLACE_WITH_CONTRACT_UUID
@invoiceId = REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_UUID
@cutoffId = REPLACE_WITH_CUTOFF_UUID
@billingMonth = 2026-10-01

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"{{ownerEmail}}","password":"{{ownerPassword}}"}

### Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Meters created asynchronously after RoomCreated
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rooms/{{roomId}}/meters
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Contracts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Expiring ACTIVE contracts (Vietnam calendar date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/expiring?within_days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Cancel only DRAFT/SCHEDULED; this MUTATES the selected contract
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contracts/{{contractId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Tenant cancelled before activation"}

### Cutoffs awaiting confirmation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/meter-cutoffs?status=PENDING&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Confirm a real observed index; replace reading_value before sending
# Nginx supplies X-Auth-User-Id from JWT. Do not set it yourself.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/meter-cutoffs/{{cutoffId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reading_value":"123.000","manual_reason":"Confirmed from actual meter reading"}

### Queue billing for a CLOSED month. Reusing the key retries the same request.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/billing-runs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: manual-billing-{{billingMonth}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"billing_month":"{{billingMonth}}"}

### Invoice list
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Invoice detail (compare total_amount with item lines)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Retry issue after cutoffs are confirmed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Email jobs (actual local emails are visible at http://localhost:8025)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/email-jobs?page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Payment attempts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/payment-attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
